---
title: "handle_repay (Pebble Protocol: Market Internal)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_amount: assert coin.value() != 0
    q_check_amount --> q_load_asset: asset = assets.load_mut_by_type(name)
    q_load_asset --> q_get_min: min_borrow_amount = asset_config.min_borrow_amount
    q_get_min --> q_accrue: accrue_interest(name, reserves, config, model, now)
    q_accrue --> q_load_obligation: obligation = obligations.borrow_mut(obligation_id)
    q_load_obligation --> q_check_market: assert obligation.market_id() == self.id
    q_check_market --> q_get_old_debt: old_borrow_amount = debt.unsafe_debt_amount()
    q_get_old_debt --> q_get_index: borrow_index = reserve.borrow_index().value()
    q_get_index --> q_repay: residual = obligation.repay_debt(coin.value(), borrow_index)
    q_repay --> q_enforce_min: enforce_post_borrow_repay_invariant(min_borrow_amount)
    q_enforce_min --> q_get_new_debt: new_borrow_amount (or zero if no debt left)
    q_get_new_debt --> q_split_refund: refund = coin.split(residual, ctx)
    q_split_refund --> q_update_emode: emode_group.update_asset_borrow(old, new)
    q_update_emode --> q_reduce_limiter: emode.borrow_limiter.reduce_outflow(now, coin.value())
    q_reduce_limiter --> q_reserve_repay: reserve.repay_amount(coin)
    q_reserve_repay --> q_try_stop_adl: try_stop_borrow_deleverage if applicable
    q_try_stop_adl --> [*]: return (refund, borrow_index, new_borrow_amount)

    note right of q_repay
        INV-001: debt accrued to current borrow_index before repay
        INV-002: if repay >= debt ceil, debt is cleared and residual returned
        INV-003: if debt becomes zero, debt entry removed from obligation
        INV-004: debt must be >= min_borrow or zero after repay
    end note

    note right of q_reserve_repay
        INV-005: if repay > total reserve debt, excess goes to cash_reserve
        INV-006: reserve cash increases by repay amount
    end note
